You can also use !startsub NAME and !endsub to indicate sections of text to include from other files using !includesub. ... file2.puml
@startuml
title this contains only B and D
!includesub file1.puml!BASIC
@enduml
This file would be rendered exactly as if:
@startuml
title this contains only B and D
B -> B : stuff2
D -> D : stuff4
@enduml
